{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-59-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/B-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-41-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>張先生和張太太表示，自從重建消息公布後，他們一直逐步清貨，眼見進度差不多完成，幾個月前決定於7月31日結業。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/C-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-27-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/D-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-14-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-49-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/F-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-42-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>店舖樓面接近700平方呎，設有幾個高及天花板的書架。張太說，現在很難再找到這樣大的空間，讓漫畫店存放書籍。「唔止最熱門嘅漫畫，其他唔算大熱但好睇嘅，我哋都有。」</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/G-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-04-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/H-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-30-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/I-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-50-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/J-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-54-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>張先生幫客人封好一個箱，順手將手推車推上送貨車，邊說：「我擔心年輕人唔慣推車。」</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-23-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/L-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-12-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/M-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-26-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/N-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-25-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/O-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-63-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/P-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-43-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Q-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-58-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/R-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-09-683x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/S-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-61-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/T-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-66-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>全文報道：彩虹邨重建｜漫畫世界 最後分店結業 起跌笑面對 割價清貨答謝：「總有完結嘅一日」</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T18:10:58.540454+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":22,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}